    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Keller Williams Team Castles are thrilled to present 151A Crumlin Road—an extraordinary, architecturally designed A2-rated new build mews property offering c. 100 sq.m of cutting-edge contemporary living, complete with polished concrete floors, 3 full bathrooms, and a stunning private roof garden.\r\n\r\nKeller Williams Team Castles are proud to introduce this exceptional new build mews home to the Dublin 12 market. Representing the pinnacle of modern design and energy efficiency, 151A Crumlin Road combines bold industrial-chic aesthetics with effortless functionality in a central, highly accessible location.\r\n\r\nMeasuring a generous 100 sq.m, the property features striking polished concrete flooring running throughout the main living areas, providing a sleek, ultra-modern aesthetic alongside exceptional thermal retention. The clever layout offers 2 to 3 flexible bedrooms and 3 full bathrooms, catering perfectly to young , remote workers, or buyers seeking room for a home office or guest suite.\r\n\r\nBoth main double bedrooms are fitted with custom built-in wardrobes for optimal storage. A standout architectural feature of this unique home is the private roof garden, accessed directly via double patio doors from the bedroom accommodation—creating a secluded, elevated sanctuary for outdoor relaxation, morning coffee, or evening entertaining.\r\n\r\nBoasting an exceptional A2 BER rating (58.23 kWh/m²/yr), this energy-efficient new build offers ultra-low running costs, sustainable living, and eligibility for maximum Green Mortgage interest rate discounts.\r\n\r\nSituated on the Crumlin Road, the location provides unmatched convenience. Crumlin Village, Sundrive Shopping Centre, and local cafes are all within walking distance, while Children's Health Ireland at Crumlin is just down the road. Commuting to Dublin City Centre is effortless thanks to a prime Quality Bus Corridor (QBC) right outside your door, with quick access to the Grand Canal, Luas Red Line, and the M50 motorway.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing with Keller Williams Team Castles is highly recommended to appreciate this one-of-a-kind mews home."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway: Polished concrete floors, clean architectural lines, and guest bathroom access.\r\n\r\nOpen-Plan Living / Kitchen Area: Ultra-modern living area with polished concrete flooring, contemporary kitchen fittings, and ample dining space.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 (Master): Spacious double bedroom featuring custom built-in wardrobes and private en-suite bathroom.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: Generous double bedroom with built-in wardrobes and direct double-door access out to the roof garden.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 / Study: Versatile space ideal as a nursery, third bedroom, or executive home office setup.\r\n\r\nBathrooms (3 Total): 3 full, beautifully finished bathrooms with modern tiling and luxury fixtures.\r\n\r\nRoof Garden: Private, paved/decked elevated roof terrace providing seamless indoor-outdoor flow.\r\n\r\nBER: A2 | BER No: 119143543 | Energy Performance Indicator: 58.23 kWh/m²/yr"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "A2-Rated BER: Exceptional energy performance (58.23 kWh/m²/yr) ensuring ultra-low utility bills and Green Mortgage eligibility.\r\n\r\nMews Style Architecture: Contemporary design spanning c. 100 sq.m of luxurious living space.\r\n\r\nPolished Concrete Flooring: Sleek, low-maintenance concrete finish downstairs with high thermal efficiency.\r\n\r\nPrivate Roof Garden: Elevated outdoor space accessed seamlessly via double doors from the bedrooms.\r\n\r\n3 Full Bathrooms: Excellent accommodation profile featuring high-end modern sanitary ware throughout.\r\n\r\nBuilt-in Storage: Floor-to-ceiling built-in wardrobes in both primary bedrooms.\r\n\r\nFlexible 2/3 Bed Layout: Versatile floor plan suitable for home office or multi-use living.\r\n\r\nPrime Transport Links: Direct QBC bus routes into Dublin City Centre right on your doorstep."
      },
      {
